{"v":4,"catch":"很高興再次見到你！\n致你 ，PAC-MANIA。","desc":"《PAC-MANIA》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1987年發行的動作遊戲。\n1980 年 PAC-MAN 誕生 7 年後……終於在 3D 中轟動一時！\n貪吃的 PAC-MAN 跳起來躲避追著的 GHOSTS，今天繼續吃 PAC-DOTS。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-12-08","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fefa806f38fa5e0615d27dd1c1b94f5032126820f728d64af571fa39910f99be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9647f8bf3f236c970e70ed5beaffae24bda45fea99653d28338e310592af9949.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/952714f39a809190a8f7c382d5ceea546aa53b57acb3e60fe4736c4b8d6af4eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c7a1826e5dd682914f2300b807052287ae7c6aeed3e088f95f063df8a33dfa19.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/993a2f303c27662424e90364dea7be9c1be6d1f8750fc65588849870641cab00.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/67a73228d334aed2ba14f42369510976e0e9ef208ad54ea7df7abf433e02ef3e.jpg"],"titleId":"01007dc018b6c000","dlc":[]}